@BasketSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5204

### Top-ranked 100 products (stars desc)
GET {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/products/top
Accept: application/json

### Catalog paginated by price ascending
GET {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### 10 cheapest products
GET {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/products/cheapest
Accept: application/json

### Page size above 1000 is rejected (400)
GET {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=1001
Accept: application/json

### Create a new basket (returns 201 + GUID)
POST {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/baskets

### Get a basket by its id (replace the GUID with one from the create response)
GET {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/baskets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Add a (buyable, top-100) product to the basket
POST {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/baskets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 14,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Set the quantity of a basket line (use DELETE to remove instead of 0)
PUT {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/baskets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/14
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Remove a product from the basket
DELETE {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/baskets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/14

### Submit the basket as an order (calls the upstream CreateOrder)
POST {{BasketSystem_HostAddress}}/api/baskets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/submit

###
